{"summary":"Zoeti is a turn-based roguelike featuring a deck of playing cards to use skills.","description":"A once peaceful land, now overrun by monsters. You, a Star-Soul hero, are among a select few blessed to raze the land of evil. \n\nIn Zoeti, you are equipped with a deck of playing cards, with which you play card combinations (pair, full house, royal flush, etc.) to activate skills that will attack or defend against enemies. Further bolster your arsenal of skills and upgrades through battles and discovery.\n\nFeatures: \n• A Royal Flush - Every ability is associated with a poker hand; the more complex the hand, the more impactful the ability!\n• Create a Powerful Arsenal - Upgrade, purchase, or quest for new skills for your runs. Discover new synergies to overcome your opposition and create mechanically rich strategies.\n• Your Choices Have Consequences - Risk everything on a tough fight with an exceptional reward or take the easy path to guarantee victory.\n• Meet Fuzzy Friends - From Winfred the cheerful innkeeper with a powerful secret to Rabelle, the devious scoundrel just as likely to trick you as to help you.\n• Endless Possibilities - Three different game modes playable with three different characters at five different difficulties featuring dozens of different builds and hundreds of different enemies... Every run is unique!","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence, Mild Blood, Alcohol Reference","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FUN7rvbtVYk?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iK9iCxsRN7taV_CU9nW77nud3qhOX8YA4VnGqkmKPIYZCMml4JA1iMRoRosyaRXei0u_UiUnhWgqcsygLVTqRYQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6l7TLrNtgrFaAf9EbpkLa5-DWRceSLbAPdIh6LTdddHRzdx8UH7JgdxHrpHdqEY_N-WvmtQqFQYeDEU0nHco","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-cqc1GpLMiSl_lJsNhWbUWThiIqsiORF615k_8NktceH8GAHvD1UCKuG0eqayxgbPdxRsIh0zB8qmbZKpyF","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-